&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example Labs&lt;/strong&gt; builds evaluation tools for language models &amp;amp; the agents that use them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will design agents that read job postings, write tests for them&lt;br&gt;and ship them to production every week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build agents &amp;amp; tools in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the evaluation pipeline&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;offline benchmarks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;online checks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draw charts with the &amp;lt;canvas&amp;gt; element and its &amp;amp;nbsp; entity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;A salary of 70k to 85k&amp;nbsp;EUR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Visa sponsorship is not available for this role&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Example Labs is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
